From: PiSight local diagnostics <pisight@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] usb: dwc2: align delayed audio enable to preceding SOF

The interval8 audio endpoint was enabled in target-3, leaving a same-parity
slot at target-2 with no host poll. Recorded video recovery decisions cluster
at target-1. Wake the existing timer at target-2, then use a temporary SOF
interrupt to enable only during target-1. Keep DMA ownership, NAK retirement
and the conservative incomplete-event guard. Mask SOF after the last waiter.

Hardware effectiveness remains unverified.

--- a/drivers/usb/dwc2/core.h
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc2/core.h
@@ -136,11 +136,12 @@
